ERRED SHARE DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'MAYFIELD VILLAGE, OHIO, AUG. 08, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ON AUGUST 5, 2022, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PROGRESSIVE CORPORATION (NYSE:PGR) DECLARED A $0.10 PER COMMON SHARE DIVIDEND, PAYABLE OCTOBER 14, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON OCTOBER 7, 2022 (EX-DIVIDEND DATE OF OCTOBER 6, 2022).'}{'symbol': 'RF', 'date': '2022-08-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'REGIONS BANK NAMES TOM SPEIR AS HEAD OF STRATEGY AND CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT', 'text': 'BIRMINGHAM, ALA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--REGIONS BANK ANNOUNCED TOM SPEIR HAS BEEN ELEVATED TO SERVE AS HEAD OF STRATEGY AND CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT.'}{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-08-08 17:10:00', 'title': 'ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF $1.15 BILLION SENIOR CONVERTIBLE NOTES OFFERING AND REPURCHASE OF $1.15 BILLION EXISTING SENIOR CONVERTIBLE NOTES', 'text': 'MIAMI , AUG. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP (NYSE: RCL) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT CLOSED ITS OFFERING OF $1.15 BILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 6.00% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2025 (THE "CONVERTIBLE NOTES"), INCLUDING $150 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE CONVERTIBLE NOTES ISSUED PURSUANT TO THE EXERCISE IN FULL OF THE INITIAL PURCHASERS\' OPTION TO BUY ADDITIONAL CONVERTIBLE NOTES. THE CONVERTIBLE NOTES WILL MATURE ON AUGUST 15, 2025.'}{'symbol': 'NOW', 'date': '2022-08-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'BALBIX ANNOUNCES NEW INTEGRATIONS WITH SERVICENOW TO FURTHER AUTOMATE AND IMPROVE CYBER RISK QUANTIFICATION', 'text': 'INTEGRATIONS WITH SERVICENOW CMDB AND ITSM AUTOMATICALLY MAP CYBER RISK TO BUSINESS HIERARCHIES AND RISK MITIGATION WORKFLOWS, ELIMINATING THOUSANDS OF HOURS REQUIRED TO OPERATIONALIZE CYBER RISK QUANTIFICATION LAS VEGAS , AUG. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BALBIX, THE LEADER IN CYBERSECURITY POSTURE AUTOMATION, ANNOUNCED TODAY NEW INTEGRATIONS WITH SERVICENOW (NYSE: NOW), THE LEADING DIGITAL WORKFLOW COMPANY. AS A RESULT OF THE INTEGRATIONS, CUSTOMERS CAN AUTOMATICAL